## Composition with other classes

- **`:mm/Tag`** — tags reference their scheme via `:mm.tag/in-scheme`
- **`:mm/Vocabulary`** — schemes can name their authoritative vocabulary identifier
- **`:mm/Dataset`** — schemes can be members of named datasets per DCAT pattern

